1. **People & Headshots:** All photographs, portraits, and likenesses of orchestra members, founders, trustees, arrangers, and conductors located in `assets/people/` or anywhere else in this repository.
2. **Branding & Logos:** The London Video Game Orchestra logos, brand identity, and custom graphical marks located in `assets/logo/` or `favicon.*`.
3. **Concert Programmes & Documents:** All concert programmes, PDFs, and written publication materials located in `assets/programmes/`.
